   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Nellie Kane**: back after 134 archived shows (623 days); rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Mackinac Rag**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Soon Forget**: back after 74 archived shows (373 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Dig a Little Deeper in the Well**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **I Dreamed I Saw St. Augustine**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Sitting in Limbo**: back after 107 archived shows (523 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **I'm Gone, Long Gone**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-04-18.AKGck63** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 162 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Heard through the AKG ck63 microphones, the recording comes across as very smooth [3]\n- **billystrings2023-04-18.cm3.om1.taraszki.flac16**: source not stated; 25 songs; 161 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer watched the livestream of this show, which they rarely do, before hearing the recording [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-04-18.AKGck63**: taped by mccordo; transferred by mccordo; source: AKG ck63 (DINa) > nBob Actives > Sound Devices MixPre > Sony PCM-A10 [1]\n- **billystrings2023-04-18.cm3.om1.taraszki.flac16**: taped by Craig Taraszki; transferred by Craig Taraszki; source: Line Audio cm3> Apogee Mini-MP> Tascam DR70D + Line Audio om1 (-18dB)> DR70D (24/48) [2]. Also: Recorded with Line Audio cm3 (21cm, 110 degrees) and om1 (23cm, 110 degrees) microphones, the om1 via an -18dB in-line attenuator; Mics fed an Apogee Mini-MP into a Tascam DR-70D recorder at 24-bit/48kHz; Processed in Audacity (low/high-pass filters, EQ, mixing, normalizing, fades, tracking), exported as FLAC16, and tagged in Foobar2000 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Tampa Fl Yuengling Center Tampa April 18 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-tampa-fl-yuengling-center-tampa-april-18-2023-poster) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center - Tampa, FL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/yuengling-center-tampa-fl-2/) [6]\n- Fan art by Shows I Go To: [PHOTOS + REVIEW — Billy Strings in Tampa & St. Augustine 2023 ⋆ Shows I Go To](https://showsigoto.com/photos/billy-strings-2023/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center - Tampa, FL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/yuengling-center-tampa-fl-3/) [8]",
